elia recalls decades of neglect, but its earlier job remains Alvarion's speculation rather than established history."},["gate"]="HISTORICAL",["id"]="npc-250929",["kind"]="figure",["npcIDs"]={250929},["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"92698:description:1-201","92698:objective:1-73"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=92698,["sourceHash"]="9c4d7025af84a3736cc152b989edf94603f838ae84037f481d0cada24dad9e3f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL",["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/92698",["title"]="Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct"},{["aliases"]={"Deathguard Kristof"},["category"]="figures",["fields"]={["context"]="Deathguard Kristof gathers reports on the fog sheltering Scourge in Lordaeron's ruins. He identifies Rath'mael as its source and urges an attack while acknowledging that necromancers can be replaced."},["gate"]="HISTORICAL",["id"]="npc-251001",["kind"]="figure",["npcIDs"]={251001},["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"92422:description:1-209","92422:objective:1-59"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=92422,["sourceHash"]="a995cb076956c1f9f46f9870db1666b22c077bf05e4a44d603f263eb9a9bb028"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL",["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/92422",["title"]="Deathguard Kristof"},{["aliases"]={"Constable Aonda"},["category"]="figures",["fields"]={["context"]="Constable Aonda must protect Shen'dar with too few peacekeepers. Her assignments move from the bandit refuge to gathering intelligence on the Al'Aketh, while the lives of her defenders outweigh possession of a minor watchtower."},["gate"]="HISTORICAL",["id"]="npc-251523",["kind"]="figure",["npcIDs"]={251523},["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"92514:description:1-234","92514:objective:1-83"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=92514,["sourceHash"]="2ceb4e3cede6aa1649356c8a5aea2847a4fa4c4b68cbd907f77fab2697946bca"},{["atomIDs"]={"92517:description:1-237","92517:objective:1-66"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=92517,["sourceHash"]="cf3d81ec031179f1d6c1b443aefa2d0d91e780ab040e13b10c3dfa3b46095694"},{["atomIDs"]={"92528:description:1-247","92528:objective:1-90"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=92528,["sourceHash"]="1a3b98043ea3af2b7dd5f273d3f190905f0ca96c08788133d3d706a85f9630de"},{["atomIDs"]={"92550:description:1-213","92550:objective:1-101"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=92550,["sourceHash"]="cbf0dfd7d325a45d1a7d105fb88fe0b0610f60e25fe612ace24355a3d7e8cdbf"},{["atomIDs"]={"93036:description:1-227","93036:objective:1-91"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=93036,["sourceHash"]="6b772cf265b785e185438f525e99584b527f96fbd8d221ef3fd9be9a9ecb3fe7"},{["atomIDs"]={"93926:description:1-197","93926:objective:1-89"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=93926,["sourceHash"]="79cda27e20b99f1fdbc582f661a1fffb244cf38a38b213e9392c473d53a49f6f"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL",["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/92514",["title"]="Constable Aonda"},{["aliases"]={"Illaya Amberwind"},["category"]="figures",["fields"]={["context"]="Illaya Amberwind is Shen'dar's resident Windshaper elder. She teaches the importance of the skysight and fears that High Order interference at sacred stones could damage the fragile bonds sustaining Zephras."},["gate"]="HISTORICAL",["id"]="npc-251902",["kind"]="figure",["npcIDs"]={251902},["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"92595:description:1-195","92595:objective:1-83"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=92595,["sourceHash"]="47865ded0bab06eb5d9767e72362a3f2a8c98b200ffcfb39c98997d65e7b5ec6"},{["atomIDs"]={"94411:description:1-269","94411:objective:1-78"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=94411,["sourceHash"]="6ae1428a6bb018ff99d4973c29fe7ddb25468f8d204ebc0d8592ce583e3e03e4"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL",["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/92595",["title"]="Illaya Amberwind"},{["aliases"]={"Sania Silverstream"},["category"]="figures",["fields"]={["context"]="Sania Silverstream recruits for the Al'Aketh from within Shen'dar Village. She presents contrition before Al'Akir as the answer to the spirits' abandonment and marks recruits for reception at Falaath; that explanation is her order's doctrine."},["gate"]="HISTORICAL",["id"]="npc-251904",["kind"]="figure",["npcIDs"]={251904},["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"92529:description:1-266","92529:objective:1-57"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=92529,["sourceHash"]="633db4e37bdcb21f12a329db3696d75d99c1583928c6d30deadfa04e76c45624"},{["atomIDs"]={"93036:description:1-227","93036:objective:1-91"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=93036,["sourceHash"]="6b772cf265b785e185438f525e99584b527f96fbd8d221ef3fd9be9a9ecb3fe7"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL",["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/92529",["title"]="Sania Silverstream"},{["aliases"]={"Zerril Softbreeze"},["category"]="figures",["fields"]={["context"]="Zerril Softbreeze keeps Shen'dar supplied with food despite dangerous conditions for hunting and foraging. The cook also teaches the foundation of a campsite, linking a village kitchen's skills with survival on the road."},["gate"]="HISTORICAL",["id"]="npc-251905",["kind"]="figure",["npcIDs"]={251905},["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"92553:description:1-225","92553:objective:1-83"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=92553,["sourceHash"]="6997ceaae9f39a7f0b68362e3c7bb920878ff44a7855197c296da257494a94b7"},{["atomIDs"]={"96646:description:1-204","96646:objective:1-78"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=96646,["sourceHash"]="6bea712b79ee7fb8697fbb7af593624fa58091d9df46afef45fa7314469f7117"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL",["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/92553",["title"]="Zerril Softbreeze"},{["aliases"]={"Teeri Wellwind"},["category"]="figures",["fields"]={["context"]="Teeri Wellwind deals with two hazards to the highlands' ordinary travel and trade: aggressive hippogryph nesting grounds and stolen windstones. Recovering a few stores can help immediately without repairing the underlying supply routes."},["gate"]="HISTORICAL",["id"]="npc-251906",["kind"]="figure",["npcIDs"]={251906},["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"92516:description:1-205","92516:objective:1-83"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=92516,["sourceHash"]="152e3d40f9163128bfcd675c50f87c05aa9393148a59cc016b6eb5cb97afdbd7"},{["atomIDs"]={"93319:description:1-215","93319:objective:1-77"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=93319,["sourceHash"]="06f360269760f1cfa28da81ebaa6207b056f690b55b8850caa543ce871bb46b3"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL",["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/92516",["title"]="Teeri Wellwind"},{["aliases"]={"Taleen Shimmerthread"},["category"]="figures",["fields"]={["context"]="Taleen Shimmerthread makes adornments from colorful, soft hippogryph down. She defends beauty as a small source of happiness worth preserving even while larger dangers beset Zephras."},["gate"]="HISTORICAL",["id"]="npc-251991",["kind"]="figure",["npcIDs"]={251991},["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"93951:description:1-217","93951:objective:1-73"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=93951,["sourceHash"]="88eb242423d2c6c58f1ebc4ad43fcdcfb61600c3158349bbef7c5295e5d81032"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL",["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/93951",["title"]="Taleen Shimmerthread"},{["aliases"]={"Indari Sunseam"},["category"]="figures",["fields"]={["context"]="Indari Sunseam asks for prideclaw pelts as predators encroach on Shen'dar's borders. The request combines preventing an attack on the village with turning the hides into useful goods."},["gate"]="HISTORICAL",["id"]="npc-251993",["kind"]="figure",["npcIDs"]={251993},["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"92515:description:1-200","92515:objective:1-71"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=92515,["sourceHash"]="0f58440c724410717f95f0b321a2bfa67a4b22544ecd81e10bf92132a329bae8"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL",["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/92515",["title"]="Indari Sunseam"},{["aliases"]={"Peacekeeper Vaaniel"},["category"]="figures",["fields"]={["context"]="Peacekeeper Vaaniel commands the western watchtower detail in Aonda's account. The recall assignment leads to his body and a bloodied note; knowledge of that fate belongs after the tower has been investigated."},["gate"]="HISTORICAL",["id"]="npc-252155",["kind"]="figure",["npcIDs"]={252155},["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"93926:description:1-197","93926:objective:1-89"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=93926,["sourceHash"]="79cda27e20b99f1fdbc582f661a1fffb244cf38a38b213e9392c473d53a49f6f"},{["atomIDs"]={"93927:description:1-128","93927:objective:1-74"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=93927,["sourceHash"]="9cfb2cf25148bbbb403733b706422f10510512786f9b1f0cf29aa0f27955ec0c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL",["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/93926",["title"]="Peacekeeper Vaaniel"},{["aliases"]={"Danarii Bellowveil"},["category"]="figures",["fields"]={["context"]="Danarii Bellowveil handles practical relief for Shen'dar, from stolen caravan supplies to payment for Vulgara's bounty. Recovered goods are destined first for townsfolk in greatest need."},["gate"]="HISTORICAL",["id"]="npc-252172",["kind"]="figure",["npcIDs"]={252172},["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"92551:description:1-245","92551:objective:1-64"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=92551,["sourceHash"]="ef9dfb838dc8627d74e00ac7f202ce3ce957769e2dcf7b788bcd7afb04652a08"},{["atomIDs"]={"93318:description:1-214","93318:objective:1-65"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=93318,["sourceHash"]="8ed95c011af087ab670e3c7c673bcdd56fae74791b7a14bfa2593e5ddc09f472"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL",["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/92551",["title"]="Danarii Bellowveil"},{["aliases"]={"Lotheluum Starbreeze"},["category"]="figures",["fields"]={["context"]="Lotheluum Starbreeze teaches druids at Valanaar and watches for word from the Shadowgale conclave. The silence worries him amid Ban'aethal's destruction, and reports from the den may demand action by the High Elder."},["gate"]="HISTORICAL",["id"]="npc-252359",["kind"]="figure",["npcIDs"]={252359},["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"94006:description:1-262","94006:objective:1-49"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=94006,["sourceHash"]="793f66b0ea6a25d0aa8474786222dce997f7a531994cc250d8e948db3381dc75"},{["atomIDs"]={"94484:description:1-252","94484:objective:1-74"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=94484,["sourceHash"]="1251adecd3205c9ed758e11ab257f3618fa4129578893b590ab74a0037339b91"},{["atomIDs"]={"94491:description:1-204","94491:objective:1-68"},["minimumStage"]=4,["questID"]=94491,["sourceHash"]="7187b142272b71f45afb4f48024032416abdaa6e938d7690348e028fc42c8a8c"}},["questSourceProofsMode"]="ALL",["referenceStatus"]="PUBLISHER_REPORTED_BETA_CAPTURE_BUILD_UNREPORTED",["sourceURL"]="https://warcraftforever.games/quests/94006",["title"]="Lotheluum Starbreeze"},{["aliases"]={"Alvarion Windfield"},["category"]="figures",["fields"]={["context"]="Alvarion Windfield reaches Valanaar injured and looking for fighters to save his orchard. He directs help west to Aamelia, leaving her to explain the danger awaiting anyone who accepts."},["gate"]="HISTORICAL",["id"]="npc-252448",["kind"]="figure",["npcIDs"]={252448},["questSourceProofs"]={{["atomIDs"]={"92679:description:1-205","92679:objective:1-78"},["mini